      "created_at": "2024-08-07T16:39:21.195Z",
      "cooked": "<p>This is what we saw when we got there. <img src=\"https://forums.greaterthangames.com/images/emoji/apple/rofl.png?v=12\" title=\":rofl:\" class=\"emoji\" alt=\":rofl:\"> With the fog machine and the lights down, it was really hard to see – let alone get a picture. <img src=\"https://forums.greaterthangames.com/images/emoji/apple/wink.png?v=12\" title=\":wink:\" class=\"emoji\" alt=\":wink:\"><br>\n<div class=\"lightbox-wrapper\"><a class=\"lightbox\" href=\"https://forums.greaterthangames.com/uploads/default/original/2X/f/f8dc5a15fcc24916f831ff3d29de503fd6e0a9d1.jpeg\" data-download-href=\"https://forums.greaterthangames.com/uploads/default/f8dc5a15fcc24916f831ff3d29de503fd6e0a9d1\" title=\"3_-_Letters_Page_Podcast_01\"><img src=\"https://forums.greaterthangames.com/uploads/default/optimized/2X/f/f8dc5a15fcc24916f831ff3d29de503fd6e0a9d1_2_666x500.jpeg\" alt=\"3_-_Letters_Page_Podcast_01\" data-base62-sha1=\"zvwvTuo6iaepo0ZAx7B0WoE2hLX\" width=\"666\" height=\"500\" srcset=\"https://forums.greaterthangames.com/uploads/default/optimized/2X/f/f8dc5a15fcc24916f831ff3d29de503fd6e0a9d1_2_666x500.jpeg, https://forums.greaterthangames.com/uploads/default/optimized/2X/f/f8dc5a15fcc24916f831ff3d29de503fd6e0a9d1_2_999x750.jpeg 1.5x, https://forums.greaterthangames.com/uploads/default/optimized/2X/f/f8dc5a15fcc24916f831ff3d29de503fd6e0a9d1_2_1332x1000.jpeg 2x\" data-small-upload=\"https://forums.greaterthangames.com/uploads/default/optimized/2X/f/f8dc5a15fcc24916f831ff3d29de503fd6e0a9d1_2_10x10.png\"><div class=\"meta\">\n<svg class=\"fa d-icon d-icon-far-image svg-icon\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><use href=\"#far-image\"></use></svg><span class=\"filename\">3_-_Letters_Page_Podcast_01</span><span class=\"informations\">1920×1440 31.3 KB</span><svg class=\"fa d-icon d-icon-discourse-expand svg-icon\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><use href=\"#discourse-expand\"></use></svg>\n</div></a></div></p>\n<p>I’m looking forward to seeing Trevor’s video of it!</p>",
